      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Cloud sessions start from a fresh clone of your repository. Anything committed to the repo is available. Anything you've installed or configured only on your own machine is not."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Sessions run on managed cloud infrastructure. You can monitor them from the mobile app, and they persist even if you close your browser. See the "
        },
        {
          "kind": "element",
          "name": "a",
          "attributes": [
            [
              "href",
              "https://example.com/docs/get-started"
            ]
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "getting started guide"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " for more."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "h2",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "What is available"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Each session includes the tools needed to build, test, and commit changes. The environment is isolated per session."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "element",
      "name": "p",
      "attributes": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "You can extend the environment with a setup script. The script runs once at session start."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
